WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.542
A client asks a simple question:

00:00:02.542 --> 00:00:04.884
where do I rank on Google Maps?

00:00:04.884 --> 00:00:06.585
You say, number three.

00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:07.503
It sounds fine,

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:09.436
until you notice it is only true

00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:10.709
in one spot.

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:13.302
MarkerRank splits the map into a grid.

00:00:13.302 --> 00:00:17.140
Seven by seven makes 49 points around the business.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.249
It checks the ranking at every point,

00:00:19.249 --> 00:00:20.796
and the heat map fills in:

00:00:20.796 --> 00:00:22.156
green near the business,

00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:23.681
orange further away.

00:00:23.681 --> 00:00:25.879
Now you can see exactly which blocks

00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:27.128
are losing customers,

00:00:27.128 --> 00:00:29.926
because ranking changes street by street.

00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:31.931
One click turns it into a white

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.011
label PDF report,

00:00:33.011 --> 00:00:35.262
in your client's own language.

00:00:35.262 --> 00:00:37.212
Pricing is a flat monthly fee,

00:00:37.212 --> 00:00:39.085
and no credits expire.

00:00:39.085 --> 00:00:42.240
MarkerRank is open for a waitlist before

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.132
launch, and nothing is charged today.

00:00:45.132 --> 00:00:47.432
Join at orynavo.com/markerrank.
